# Frontend

## API so'rovlar

```typescript
import { apiRequest } from "@/lib/queryClient";

// Oddiy GET — queryKey yetarli
useQuery({ queryKey: ["/api/teachers"] });

// Parametrli GET
queryFn: async () => {
  const res = await apiRequest("GET", `/api/schedule-entries?weekStart=${weekStart}`);
  return res.json();
}

// Mutatsiya
await apiRequest("POST", "/api/rooms", data);
```

## Routing (Wouter)

```typescript
import { useLocation } from "wouter";
const [, setLocation] = useLocation();
setLocation("/teachers");
```

## UI

- shadcn/ui komponentlar: `@/components/ui/*`
- Tailwind + `cn()` (`@/lib/utils`)
- Sahifalar: `client/src/pages/`, layout: `components/layout/`
- Import alias: `@/` → `client/src/`, `@shared/` → `shared/`

## Til

Foydalanuvchiga ko'rinadigan matnlar o'zbek tilida bo'lsin.
